# www is not the canonical host (every canonical tag / sitemap URL is
# apex-only) — force it to the apex domain instead of silently serving
# duplicate content that only a canonical tag would de-dupe. Same fix as
# countlink, which Search Console flagged for exactly this (www crawled
# and indexed as a near-duplicate "alternate" of the apex page).
https://www.diffhero.app/* https://diffhero.app/:splat 301!
